-- NUMBER OUT OF RANGE FOR ITS TYPE ----------------------------- main.kl  K0126

This number doesn't fit in `Int`. A literal must be a value its type can hold, so I stop here instead of changing the number.

2│     let big = 9223372036854775808
                 ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ `Int` holds whole numbers from -9223372036854775808 to 9223372036854775807 (64 bits) on every platform

Help: Use a value the type can hold (the note under the number says why this one doesn't fit), or a type with a larger range: `BigInt` holds whole numbers of any size.

Learn more: kalam explain K0126
